        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You conjure a blade of spiritual energy and cut at the soul of a foe. Make a melee spell attack against your target's AC. On a success, you deal spirit damage. On a critical success, the target takes double damage. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines the range, damage, and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> An adjacent target takes 3d6 spirit damage.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> An adjacent target takes 6d6 spirit damage, and on a hit, it becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> The blade flies out from you and attacks a target within 30 feet, dealing 6d6 spirit damage. The spell deals half damage on a failure (but not a critical failure), as the blade's divine influence guides your attack. Unless you critically fail, the target becomes enfeebled 1 for 1 round.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for the 1-action version, or by 2d6 for the 2- and 3-action versions.</p>"
        },
